<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 2.83 mln bags by April 6.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 2.83 mln bags by April 6.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia 1996/97 cocoa arrivals totalled 2,834,701 million 60-kg bags by the week ending April 6 compared with 2,626,668 bags by April 7 last year, Brazilian Cocoa Trade Commission Comcauba said.</p>
<p>Arrivals in the three weeks from March 17 to April 6 were as follows in 60-kg bags.</p>
<p> WEEK		   1996/97   1995/96   Accumulated 1996/97</p>
<p> March 17-23	   9,772    15,772	 2,812,805</p>
<p> March 24-30	   9,698    19,923	 2,822,503</p>
<p> March 31-April 6   12,198     8,818	 2,834,701</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
